## unreleased ##
    - rename module Type into Ty
    - add Helper.value_type for types handled like C++ classes (init,
      clear, copy), and Helper.extra_input
    - add Ty.mlc.owned_by_ml; a parameter of such a type can't be input
      and output (it was finalized twice)
    - string_nt fails if the string contains a null byte, the previous
      behaviour is string_nt_prefix
    - remove the get, set, internal and malloc options of Helper.abstract,
      Helper.custom and Helper.custom_ptr (still in Expert)
    - fix leak of the elements of input_array and output_array
    - fix convert: the destination is initialized, the temporary is freed,
      the unboxed case is fixed
    - fix ignored_result: the result was not declared nor freed
    - fix bigarray_array1 conversion to C
    - documentation of the memory model

